>This is something I've wondered about recently: what range of values
>can your LUCK have?  Once you have a blessed luckstone, does it still make
>sense to chuck jewelry at onehorned beasts?

-10 to 10 (the categories are [extremely]/[very]/[]
lucky/unlucky--luck 0 gives no message).

A luckstone, in addition to keeping luck from timing out, adds I think
3 to your luck.  Until your luck is 10, it's still useful to throw
gems, hope for four-leaf clovers, etc.



